{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55247","headline":"题敦煌千龛窟（题拟） · 张盈润","name":"题敦煌千龛窟（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久事公门奉駈驰，累沐鸿恩纳效微。\n昨登长坡上大阪，走下深谷覩花池。\n傍通重开千龛窟，此谷昔闻万佛辉。\n瑞草芳芬而锦绣，祥鸟每常遶树飞。\n愚情从今归真教，世间浊滥誓不归。\n（乾佑二年六月廿三日节度押衙张盈润题。\n见敦煌莫高窟第一○八窟窟檐南壁外侧题壁，据《敦煌莫高窟供养人题记》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张盈润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}